{"name": "F.L.E.E.C.E", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"134\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361610/extras/ef3bd46344a8128810821727b299132a.avif?t=1779971151\" width=\"529\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This look like a simple: push boxes, dodge traps,, solve puzzles, and advance to the next level. Sounds like your average sokoban game, right? Bingo! That\u2019s exactly what most people think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"404\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361610/extras/ac04209f7dcbdfa08da2af797aad84a1.poster.avif?t=1779971151\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361610/extras/ac04209f7dcbdfa08da2af797aad84a1.webm?t=1779971151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361610/extras/ac04209f7dcbdfa08da2af797aad84a1.mp4?t=1779971151\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But... is this really just a sokoban game? Then the first sheep appears...USE IT TO YOUR ADVANTAGE, step on it over and over as you leap toward the final goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"404\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361610/extras/311fdee33919bfcdc2f20e4f9d6bd709.poster.avif?t=1779971151\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361610/extras/311fdee33919bfcdc2f20e4f9d6bd709.webm?t=1779971151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361610/extras/311fdee33919bfcdc2f20e4f9d6bd709.mp4?t=1779971151\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start to feel something is fishy... Puzzle after puzzle, you just can\u2019t seem to get around F.L.E.E.C.E. What is really behind all this? You might just be the one to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"404\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361610/extras/12ae2ff7ec1c667e1e0d867db62d1633.poster.avif?t=1779971151\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361610/extras/12ae2ff7ec1c667e1e0d867db62d1633.webm?t=1779971151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361610/extras/12ae2ff7ec1c667e1e0d867db62d1633.mp4?t=1779971151\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"126\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361610/extras/be645ae8a9da807fae9fe054ecbf9d9c.avif?t=1779971151\" width=\"524\"/></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore two worlds with stark contrast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve over a hundred intricately designed puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield mysterious power to summon a companion to overcome peril</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge the rules themselves to uncover the ultimate truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a thoughtful journey accompanied by original soundtracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "F.L.E.E.C.E. is an indie game that skillfully blends platforming with puzzle-solving. Everything you see here is a challenge, and the world itself is the ultimate puzzle. you need to combine your own abilities with those of a companion into the key that will move you forward to uncover the truth.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361610/6ee2ad69383867d22c9a236455cc62ac1ad0f471/header.jpg?t=1779971151", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle Platformer", "Adventure", "2D", "Puzzle", "Platformer", "Choices Matter"], "developers": "Light Mind Studio", "publishers": "Light Mind Studio", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4361610", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "28 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/z2cQLfGco70", "first_seen": 1779926400.0}